        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. The mediation conference will normally be attended by the grievant, Business Manager and those people actually involved in the grievance process. Pay for the grievant shall be allowed for the attendance at the mediation conference if it is held during the employee's scheduled tour.",
